Fix: in production, if invertedIndices is missing, `invertedIndices[value]` throws NPE (accessing property of undefined). The upstream fix (echarts commit) was:

```ts
const invertedIndices = dim && this._invertedIndicesMap[dim];
if (__DEV__) {
    if (!invertedIndices) {
        throw new Error('Do not supported yet');
    }
}
const rawIndex = invertedIndices && invertedIndices[value];
```

That's the upstream commit d3c91ed or similar. Make the minimal edit.

